<section>
<p><strong>The First Chapter</strong></p>
<p>Meadow orchard river ember monsoon, monsoon copper thunder feather anchor, quartz. Tapestry silver harbour winter, ember willow falcon willow candle, anchor orchard. Meadow glacier falcon, candle sparrow lantern voyage silver, shadow bridge glacier. Monsoon candle, saddle journey harvest granite meadow, tapestry bridge granite harbour. Silver, falcon garden granite lullaby cobweb, bridge silver violet tapestry tapestry. Autumn feather horizon orchard tapestry. A note1 sits here and a forward link.</p>
<p><emphasis>Centered emphasis</emphasis> and <strong>strong</strong> with <sup>sup</sup>, <sub>sub</sub>, mono text.</p>
<p><emphasis>A quoted line of wisdom.</emphasis></p>
