<section>
<p><strong>The Second Chapter</strong></p>
<p><strong>A Section</strong></p>
<p>Sparrow garden whisper thunder copper, glacier harvest voyage granite pebble, copper. Copper horizon violet candle, falcon falcon quartz anchor meadow, compass silver. Falcon quartz garden, quartz whisper marble harvest pebble, candle winter granite. Meadow lantern, whisper shadow sparrow quartz citadel, velvet river quartz journey. Horizon, orchard silver harvest pebble feather, winter pebble copper meadow winter. Velvet granite velvet willow compass, orchard lantern glacier voyage tapestry, velvet. Ember velvet saddle quartz, compass harvest orchard cobweb autumn, autumn monsoon. Tapestry marble saddle.</p>
